WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
iDOL B is online. Initiate the subsystems.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.410
It's not my fault!

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.870
I know. It was the Hiems' awakening
that caused it to seize up.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:26.790
It looks like when we heard that noise,
the terrible sound of its awakening,

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.410
everyone was completely surprised.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:33.040
Enough with the pseudo-explanations
already! Just what was that thing?

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.500
The Epimetheus or whatever.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.290
A manmade iDOL.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:43.830
Humans, enamored with the iDOLs' power,
tried to create a core by their own hands.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.580
THAT is the result of that project.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.330
But it was so different from the iDOLs.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:52.830
It's all mechanical, and doesn't
seem to have its own timbre...

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:53.950
Futami!

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:59.370
Hurry up and get the Nebula moving.
Next time, I WILL win.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:03.540
I'll win, and prove my own strength...

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.080
My strength as a Master.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.500
Are we still unable to contact Miss Amami?

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:10.910
Yes.

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:13.950
Signal interference has
died down quite a bit.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:16.910
She could be somewhere
it's hard to reach her.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.870
Perhaps she's been defeated.
By the Nubilum.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:24.580
Impossible! That simply can't be.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:30.580
Increase the search radius. Miss Hagiwara,
continue trying to raise Miss Amami.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.700
Sir!

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:33.500
Looks like there's no time to lose...

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.450
Haruka! Please come in.
Looks like there's no time to lose...

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:38.080
Haruka, this is base camp.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:38.700
Haruka, please come in!

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.830
Please come back safely.
Haruka, please come in!

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.160
Please come back safely.

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.080
It seems that you rescued me.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:48.450
I'm from Mondenkind EU.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.790
I'm Chihaya. Chihaya Kisaragi.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:55.910
Well, I'm glad you're all right.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:02:00.660
Oh, I'm Haruka Amami.
From Mondenkind Japan.

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:04.700
I've heard. You're an Idolmaster, aren't you?

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.790
For the Imber.

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:09.790
Yes!

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.870
S.O.S. kikoeta

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:24.790
Yatto anata ni kikoeta?

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.790
Kakko kawaiku ne

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:44.330
Fujun, junsui, dotchi no character?

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.160
Onaji na no kashira

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.700
Love beat ga sokudo zenkai

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:54.700
Kizuita, kore wa tokubetsu na mission... Wakatta

00:02:55.580 --> 00:03:01.120
Honki misechau yo, kanaechau kara

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:05.000
Sora o tsukinuketa sekai de

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:11.910
Fushigi na omoi kanjita yo, shunkan de suki!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.000
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.330
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:25.910
Naiteta chiisa na watashi ga tachimukau

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:28.250
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.540
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:39.620
Binetsu na kibun wa anata no sei kamo, S.O.S.!

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:52.040
Muspelheim

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:54.500
This is Prometheus 1, Imber and Haruka
Amami. Base camp, please come in.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.620
This is Prometheus 1.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.000
Imber...

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:20.580
Looks like it's no good.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:25.950
I see. Still, I'm worried about this iDOL.
It won't move anymore, right?

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:35.290
Oh, don't worry. The monitor's on,
so it looks like he's just sleeping a little.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:44.330
When Imber is really upset, he's sort of cold
to the touch... Anyway, he's all right.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.660
Um...

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:51.370
Could it be that you're
interested in the iDOLs?

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.000
Y-yes.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.160
Well then, let me tell you about Imber!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:01.870
The Mondenkind of other countries
don't think very highly of the iDOLs.

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:07.870
But I want everyone to know what
they're about, and to like them! So...

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.330
O-okay.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:17.500
Um, first, this is Imber. He's called by
his codename, Prometheus 1.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:22.120
He's about 30m tall and about 300 tons.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:27.870
He has sort of a mean face,
but he's actually REALLY kind! Also...

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.790
As we saw from that earthquake earlier,

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:35.290
the plates may have been kept in check by
the Hiems' inertial control system.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.250
Therefore...!

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:43.540
Yes, sir. Understood. As you wish.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.080
Sir. What did HQ say?

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.830
To recover the Hiems at once.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.540
But if we do that...

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.750
They're aware of the danger,

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:57.120
and apparently issued an evacuation
alert for all of Iceland.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:05.410
"If it means obtaining the core, an island or
two like this is a small price to pay."

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:08.200
That's what they're saying.
The guys upstairs.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:12.950
Now then, now then... Shall we get down
to making a recovery plan?

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.160
Well, everyone?

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.000
Jeez, this sucks!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:23.200
This gooey old magma is so hot!
Still, this is awesome!

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.660
Epi is totally okay!

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:30.370
That's good news. Mother is also
happy that you're unharmed.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.830
Incidentally, what of the Nubilum?
We are unable to make contact.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.410
I don't know!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:44.830
But I think they're okay. Imber and...
um, that Nebula thing, they're way weak!

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.450
Very well. Can you do it again?

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:51.120
We MUST acquire the Hiems.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:58.120
Yeah, no problem! I mean, Nebula
and its Master are all jacked up!

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.290
Very well, let's begin the operation.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.200
First is this: the crater of
the Grímsfjall volcano.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:08.750
Final check! We're going up against
super-hot, high-pressure magma!

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.450
Keep your eyes peeled.
Don't overlook the tiniest bit of damage.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:13.870
Ma'am!

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:18.370
Can't we at least wait for the
results of the simulation?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:22.450
These are HQ's orders.
We have to obey them.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.790
We're aware of the dangers.

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:30.040
But if the layer field is active, the iDOL
will be able to carry out its mission.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:34.200
Still, that's assuming the layer
will work completely.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:39.790
Earlier, I initiated Harmonizing
to awaken Nebula, but...

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.200
The values have dropped again?

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:47.790
The sound that Makoto and the Nebula
produce is extremely accurate,

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.950
the pitch cold and clear as glass.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:55.790
But it's also very brittle... and fragile.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.330
Shut up, Futami.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.830
Ma'am, do somethin'!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.910
Makoto is firin' up the Nebula on her own!

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:08.040
Makoto, wait! We haven't decided
to begin the operation yet.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:14.200
These past seven years, I've made
the iDOLs move my own way.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:20.160
I've sortied a total of 295 times,
logged 1,187 hours of mission time,

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:26.000
destroyed 187 Drops and haven't
had a single failure.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:30.790
This time is no different.
I can do it. I'll show you!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.040
Wait, Makoto!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:40.910
Shut up!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:47.700
I... I will NOT become like you!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.870
Abandoned by the iDOLs.
Throwing everything away!

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:54.410
Always lying to yourself
with a deceitful smile.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:58.790
The Nebula is now above the volcano's
crater. Layer output is increasing!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.370
I won't be like you, Sister!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:02.540
Makoto...

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:07.080
Layer deployment confirmed.
It's begun lowering.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.500
Let's believe in Miss Kikuchi.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.160
In the gifted Idolmaster
that you have raised.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:17.250
She is the one that has protected
this world for so long.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.290
Sir...

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.080
The Nebula is entering the volcano's crater.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.040
It's entered! But that's a
dangerous rate of descent!

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:31.580
Everyone!

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:35.370
Do your utmost to back up
Miss Kikuchi. Got it?

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.330
Sir!

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:40.500
Miss Futami, you and
the others continue the simulation.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:42.450
If you hurry, we may make it in time.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:44.200
Sir.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.830
That's it! All right!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:10:02.830
The Nebula is still descending into
the volcano. Depth: 1,200... 1,250... 1,300...

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:06.620
Layer field formation index is 9.6.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.950
External temperature: 357 degrees.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.790
Pressure threshold will
be reached in 3,000.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:15.120
Both frame and internal mechanisms
are operating normally.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:17.500
Cockpit temperature is 32 degrees.

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.750
Any readings from the external sensor?

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.290
It has a working radius of
a few dozen meters.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.750
We'll have to just rely on the gauges.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.830
Sis! Sis!

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:40.790
Makoto... I'm sorry.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.700
I... I lost.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.410
Sis!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.620
Move! Move, move!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.000
Why? Why?!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:57.160
Nebula. There are things I still have to do.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.450
So why...?

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:01.950
I...

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:08.580
I won't make the same mistake.
Something like this, "hearts"...

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.790
I won't let that fence me in!

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:16.450
Sometimes he gets a little sulky...

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:20.160
But sometimes, he's also in
a really good mood!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:25.160
He's kinda shy, and a bit finicky,
huh? In a way.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.200
But that's sort of cute, like-

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.830
Can I ask you something?

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.450
Is that color on the chest
your personal taste?

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:38.910
Yes! Lovely, isn't it?
It looks like Imber likes it, too.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:40.410
Really?

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:42.410
Yes, really! And also-

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.620
That's enough. I've learned a lot.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.000
Really?!

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.120
Yes.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:52.500
I've learned you know nothing about him.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:57.660
Imber hates this color. He despises it.

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:03.790
The color he likes is white.
The color of innocence, free of impurity...

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.370
Like his heart.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.910
Layer index is normal. Frame and internal
machinery both functioning normally.

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:18.040
Cockpit temperature
has reached 38 degrees.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:24.290
Another 300 to the estimated target
location. Just a little bit more, Makoto!

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:28.790
What's that?

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:29.660
Makoto! What happened? Makoto!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.540
What was that just now?
Makoto! What happened? Makoto!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.620
Makoto! What happened? Makoto!

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:36.620
Picking up an iDOL-like reading in the
vicinity of the Nebula. It's the Epimetheus!

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:45.080
Surprised? The magma here
flows to other mountains too.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.410
I'm gonna get Hiems, okay?

00:12:58.910 --> 00:12:59.580
The arm!

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.080
Layer distortion!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:05.330
Actuators 5 through 12 have been crushed!
At this rate...!

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:15.370
This is... The forcibly purged second arm
has been crushed outside the layer!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:16.660
Not yet...

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:18.500
Not yet!

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:23.910
Makoto! The layer index is dropping. At this
rate... Hey, are you listening? Makoto!

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:27.120
No. No!
Makoto! The layer index is dropping. At this
rate... Hey, are you listening? Makoto!

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.870
No! No! NO!
Makoto! The layer index is dropping. At this
rate... Hey, are you listening? Makoto!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.660
If I lose...!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:37.500
If I lose, it's all over. Move! Move!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.330
Nebula! I can't lose!

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:44.910
Makoto, calm down. Makoto! Makoto!

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:46.830
Miss Hagiwara, can you still
not raise Miss Amami?
Makoto, calm down. Makoto! Makoto!

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:49.040
Miss Hagiwara, can you still
not raise Miss Amami?
Move! MOVE, you bastard!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.410
Haruka, please respond. Haruka!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:57.540
Makoto's in danger! It's bad!
Haruka, please respond!

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:00.950
Chihaya. Why?

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:05.160
Imber was originally mine.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.660
You will now return him.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:20.120
You keep playing out of your league,
I'm gonna crush you...

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.370
To a pulp!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:31.660
Such resonance... This is bad.
At this rate, Hiems will...!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.160
"Return him"?

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.330
I have to get to the cockpit, now!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.080
Chihaya!

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:08.790
Haruka! Please come in. Haruka!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.870
Sorry, Yukiho. Hang on a minute.
Right now, someone is...
Haruka! Please come in. Haruka!

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:14.910
Haruka! Can you hear me?

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:16.700
Chihaya...
Haruka! Can you hear me?

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:17.330
Chihaya...
Makoto's in danger. Haruka, please! Hurry!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.330
Makoto's in danger. Haruka, please! Hurry!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.000
Let's go, Imber!
Makoto's in danger. Haruka, please! Hurry!

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:30.250
There's no way you can beat
good friends like me and Epi!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:31.870
You're an idiot!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.910
Okay, Epi, let's leave this chick
and go see Heims!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:48.950
Why? Tell me, why?! Nebula!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:58.040
The Nebula's layer index has lowered
to 3.1. That's the pressure threshold!

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:01.540
Surface temperature has reached
700 degrees. At this rate...!

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:04.790
Makoto, hang in there! Makoto!

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.000
I have the results of the simulation.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:13.540
It can't be!

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:16.700
What's going on? If we lose the core...

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.790
The seismic energy that has built up
over the past 20 years will run wild.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.700
And Iceland will sink.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:30.120
We... and Makoto, who's still
inside the magma, we'll all...!

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:32.370
It can't be!

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.580
What can we do to stop it?

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:39.250
Haruka!

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.700
You're all right? Are you hurt?

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.040
I'm fine. And Imber, too.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:49.660
More importantly, what can we do to
help Miss Kikuchi? Please tell me!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.870
The Epimetheus is approaching the core.
It will soon arrive!

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:58.500
Found ya.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.870
There's just one possibility.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:08.370
But we'll have to give up on Hiems.
Is that all right?

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:13.910
It's all right. Rescuing Miss Kikuchi and

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:17.410
securing the people on
this island take priority.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:23.370
Haruka, head for the crater
of Grímsfjall at full speed

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:26.000
and then shift to Tragheit Brecher!

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:34.000
I'm all aflutter!

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.660
It's not a physical attack,

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:41.200
just driving inertial energy at the contact
point between the plates.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:43.410
Will that really work?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.250
We don't know.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:49.410
But if it goes well, it should be able to
cancel out the energy from the quake.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.700
"Should be"?!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.790
I leave the rest to you.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:57.620
To the trust you and Imber share,
the harmony between you two.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:01.540
Both of you, please play
your greatest tune!

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.950
Imber and I?

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:14.160
Please listen, Imber.
I want to help Makoto. I want to...

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.200
protect everyone!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:20.250
So, lend me your strength!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:34.250
I believe in you, Imber.
So, Imber, believe in me!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:39.830
Imber...

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:42.370
Imber is singing.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.250
He's responding to Haruka's faith in him.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:47.870
Such...

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.830
Such beautiful harmony!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.410
An object is approaching the Imber.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:00.160
It's the Nubilum!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:02.790
Chihaya...

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:07.290
The Epimetheus has reached the Hiems!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.000
Okay, come on...

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.250
Hiems!

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.290
DANGER

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.330
Let's go, Imber!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.620
Imber! It's me, Chihaya!

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:43.080
You know that, right?

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:47.250
Stop this! Don't do what that child says!

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:48.540
MOVE!

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:24.830
Success! All distorted seismic energy
has dissipated!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.450
To think, they could actually do it...

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:38.040
You're incredible, Haruka! Imber!

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:46.500
I never thought they'd pull it off.

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:49.120
Those girls are something else.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:56.500
Why, Imber?

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:04.370
I gave you everything.
My heart, my body. And yet...

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:06.500
Chihaya! Hey!

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.160
I got Hiems!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.830
Huh? You're not gonna praise me?

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:15.450
No "Riffa, you're awesome!"
or "Epi is so cool"?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.540
I'm heading back.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:24.950
The Nebula was severely damaged.

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:28.700
But it looks like Makoto is all right. Still...

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.910
Thank you.

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:40.250
Really, great work, Imber.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.450
Wow!

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:05.370
Toki o wataru seija no you ni

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:14.370
Donna kodoku ni naite ita no?

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:23.250
Haruka tooi hoshi o tsunagi

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:31.790
Ne, omoi o egaku wa, sora o miagete

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:43.250
Dear boy, itsumo kokoro ni anata o sagaseba

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:52.200
Ah, dakishimeru hodo ni tsuyoi hikari o hanatsu no

00:22:52.200 --> 00:23:01.160
Mabataku kidou ga futari no mejirushi

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:12.750
Ima doko de mite ite mo truth kanjitete

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:41.080
Preview
Room No. 501

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:30.700
Karasu! I undid my hair and
it won't go back to how it was!

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:36.750
Fine, here goes. So, this goes
like THIS, and... Um...

00:23:36.750 --> 00:23:37.700
No good?

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.160
Fine, here goes. I'll take it off
with a pair of clippers.

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:40.290
Huh?!
